{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028402001:1":{"text":"엘로란 아저씨, 왜 걱정스러운 얼굴을 하고 계세요?","source_cn":"埃罗兰大叔，你怎么愁眉苦脸的一个人在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x192D8F2E93B5A8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028402002:1":{"text":"라이카구나. 어휴, 이제 곧 장마철인데 집에 무슨 일인지 대들보가 썩기 시작했어. 새집을 아직 다 짓지도 못했는데, 예전 집의 대들보를 바꿀 수도 없고, 이거 난감하구나.","source_cn":"是莱卡啊。唉，雨季快到了，我这旧房子的房梁不知道为什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404458C132C1020D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028402003:1":{"text":"목재가 부족해! 마을 채집대가 나간 지 열흘이 넘었는데 소식도 없고...","source_cn":"木料不够啊！村子里的采集队出去十几天了，可一点消息都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF802C7BA84045C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028402004:1":{"text":"치피는 집에 대해 잘은 모르지만, 적당한 목재를 찾으려면 시간이 오래 걸리겠죠?","source_cn":"满满不是很懂建房子，可是，要寻找合适的木料确实需要很多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60D132581969392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028402005:1":{"text":"그렇지만 채집대는 보급품을 겨우 열흘 치만 가져가서 그리 오래 걸리지 않을 텐데...","source_cn":"照理说用不了这么久……他们只带了十天的补给。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x167BE51D36C84C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028402006:1":{"text":"휴, 무슨 일이 있는 건 아닌지... 음식을 보충하러 온 사람도 없어...","source_cn":"唉，也不知道是不是出什么事了，他们连个回来补充食物的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE834A43D7FA9A95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028402007:1":{"text":"열흘 넘게 안 돌아오고 소식도 없다고요?... 뭔가 이상하네요... ","source_cn":"十几天都没回来，而且还没有任何消息？嗯……这确实不对劲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16B4479F2F757CAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028402008:1":{"text":"라이카... 시간이 되면 채집대 좀 찾아봐 주겠니?","source_cn":"莱卡……你们如果有空的话，能不能去找找他们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x260DB9C947817000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028402009:1":{"text":"채집대도 걱정이고 새집도 걱정이지만... 야수들이 너무 무서워서 참...","source_cn":"我担心采集队的人，又惦记我那新房子……可我实在是害怕外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB0E0E2801CB66D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028402010:1":{"text":"요즘 바투소... 정말이지 너무 불안해...","source_cn":"最近的瓦度索，实在是不太平呐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E317CE5093D8BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028402011:1":{"text":"걱정하지 마세요, 엘로란 아저씨. 저희가 지금 바로 가서 알아볼게요.","source_cn":"放心吧，埃罗兰叔叔，我们这就去看看情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C40C2BE1A12F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028402012:1":{"text":"채집대가 어디로 갔죠?","source_cn":"采集队去了什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B9BCC490894222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028402013:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">마을 북쪽의 벌목장</style>으로 갔단다. 길을 따라 북쪽으로 가면 보일 거야.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>村子北边的林场</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x893EDEA463CD8942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:发愁的埃罗兰":{"text":"엘로란","source":"发愁的埃罗兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}